<mjml>
  <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF" width="660px">
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding-top="12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hello&nbsp;*|FNAME|*</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          The Tuleva Additional Investment Fund account for your child*|IF:RECIPIENTNAME|*,
          *|RECIPIENTNAME|*,*|END:IF|* is now open.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|IF:awaitingFirstPayment|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          As a next step, you can make the first contribution and get your child's saving under
          way.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|END:IF|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text>
          You can make contributions in your Tuleva account, in your child's view. There you can
          also set up a recurring payment if you like, so that saving continues automatically. The
          fund units you buy reach your child's account within two working days.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|IF:awaitingFirstPayment|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-button href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/payment/child/*|recipientAccountId|*?language=en&utm_content=onboarding_completed_child_first_payment">
          Make the first contribution
        </mj-button>
        <mj-raw>*|ELSE:|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-button href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/payment/child/*|recipientAccountId|*?type=RECURRING&language=en&utm_content=onboarding_completed_child_recurring">
          Set up recurring payment
        </mj-button>
        <mj-raw>*|END:IF|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-raw>*|IF:hasCoParent|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text><strong>Both parents can manage the account</strong></mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          So that the other parent can also see and manage your child's account, share this link
          with them:<br />
          <a href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/onboarding/child?language=en">pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/onboarding/child?language=en</a>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          After logging in, they can confirm that they are the child's parent. They will then see
          the child's account in their own Tuleva account too.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-raw>*|END:IF|*</mj-raw>
        <mj-text><strong>Where is your child's money invested?</strong></mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Tuleva Additional Investment Fund is a broadly diversified index fund that invests in
          world equity markets. The ongoing fees are *|savingsFundFee|*%&nbsp;per year, with no
          entry, exit or performance fees.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          If you would like to know more about saving for your child, here are answers to common
          questions:
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <a href="https://tuleva.ee/en/child-savings/">Saving for your child</a>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <a href="https://tuleva.ee/en/additional-investment-fund/why-use-an-investment-account-for-the-additional-investment-fund/">
            Why use an investment account for the Additional Investment Fund?
          </a>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <a href="https://tuleva.ee/en/additional-investment-fund/where-does-the-tuleva-additional-investment-fund-invest/">
            Where does the Tuleva Additional Investment Fund invest?
          </a>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          If you have any questions, feel free to get in touch at
          <a href="mailto:tuleva@tuleva.ee">tuleva@tuleva.ee</a> or
          <a href="tel:+3726445100">644&nbsp;5100</a>.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="0 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding-top="12px">
          Tõnu Pekk<br />
          Founder and fund manager of Tuleva
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/disclaimer_savings_en.mjml" />
    <mj-include path="./partials/footer_bottom_fund.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
